Package: shoplanner-backend
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Dmitriy Tikhomirov <uroborosq@gmail.com>
Section: net
Priority: optional
Depends: libc6 (>= @LIBC@), openssl, systemd, init-system-helpers (>= 1.54)
Description: ShoPlanner backend
 HTTP API server for ShoPlanner: shopping lists, favorites, products and shop
 maps, backed by a local SQLite database.
 .
 Runs as the shoplanner.service systemd unit. Configuration lives in
 /etc/shoplanner/backend.yml, state in /var/lib/shoplanner.
